title: 'statement-store: keep up to K routing peers reserved on the v2 DHT path'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    With the v2 DHT path on, peer steering keeps up to `replication_factor` routing peers reserved
    besides the peers covering the node's topics: the nearest known peer of every distance bucket
    from the node's key, then the nearest peers overall.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
